The real fight isn’t out there. It’s within you. 

The conversation you have with yourself at 4am when nothing’s working and quitting would be the easiest thing in the world.

Every chapter, the opponent changed jerseys but kept the same face. Mine.

If you’re in that fight right now, don’t give up. The next level needs the version of you that refused to stay down.

300lbs → College Grad with some internships & a Ruptured Achilles → Amazon delivery → AE → Chief of Staff → Founder → footballer in Germany.

I didn’t beat the odds. I beat the version of me that wanted to fold.

#DontGiveUp #Mindset #Founder #Footballer #K2E